  "question": "What search-mode semantics are explicitly documented by the first-party new-platform manual, and what remains unresolved before any target query?",
  "answer": "The first-party new-platform OOXML manual is a 2024 operational document. It explicitly documents ordinary, advanced and professional search. Advanced search supports all-field or single-field conditions including 题名, 作者 and 文献来源, time-bounded precise/fuzzy search, and multiple conditions related by 与/或/非. Professional search uses category-dependent field-code tables and Solr field-code:content expressions, with AND for multiple conditions. The actual category-specific field-code table values are not closed by paragraph-text extraction and must not be guessed.",
